# mdBook build (docs/ is committed for GitHub Pages)
# book/
# mdBook local build output for translated books (CI builds into docs/)
i18n/en/book/
i18n/ja/book/

# mdBook build output (book.toml build-dir = "docs").
# Generated fresh by .github/workflows/pages.yml on every push and uploaded
# via upload-pages-artifact; the committed copy was only ever a stale duplicate.
# Pages source is GitHub Actions (deploy-pages@v4), not "deploy from branch".
docs/
